{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006_04_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0454a1a956f016996da3bb6648df3118b04301b0467fb30c7fece5e0ece4ab5b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3749ef628f298d4188375087aab059868fd304b5f3c9120747d0ab5c192c77fb",
      "text": "接天音的人也来了，\n那我们差不多开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f2ea2b7c0ff63d3f233e308f2d2c9e97bcf397fcc4687a1956023a438efcae3",
      "text": "冒昧由我来带个头。\n为了庆祝我们3人合格……干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:732c2dc704396ca498e3003ed5fb18a982e03a4f60fbb727f7403ee1f23e7cca",
      "text": "……嗯！好吃！\n这道下酒菜跟啤酒简直太搭了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09c7d83885148b38698202864f2097caac68f66193e81d97cb5fa3723e7fc7bb",
      "text": "是啊。\n诚司先生做的菜，每一样都好好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77a6631bd1178689e5612a6b4d5e0e741e81a8d7ecb33dfdf90417a82289de4a",
      "text": "谢谢。嘛，家务我都做习惯了，\n自己做饭也很多年了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8289ab8021732b943dec5cf7de4124ffea5386da9d4cc585e7b6d6b9a5027361",
      "text": "这样啊。诚司先生一个人住了很久呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1210983c9fb3103e4d633838f0f538f7a498853dcf4ca99f0c320301bdb1c4",
      "text": "应该说，我第一次见到你的时候\n你就是大人了……这么想也是理所当然的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887aeb3d6f253eedac793822233239313f4fd8a98302f5491d569875328b4085",
      "text": "说起来，龙和信玄\n很久以前就认识了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bbc7a4245431a038dcb485a3455978ddda19ff6f22749fe6c825d98e4e96285",
      "text": "跟我详细讲讲呗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e224ed03a78bcf4559a487ee9596dbc2c86ad0441cd229677c1fabb430179a2a",
      "text": "当然可以！\n呃……那大概是我16岁的时候吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_04_1_1_006_04:1_1_006_04_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d46d59bed37b5fb75d0456979a531252b71ce0129d902ed295f1c69eb252e6",
      "text": "我和家人一起去了自卫队的火力演习场，\n那时候好像出了点小乱子……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
